WEBVTT

00:00.491 --> 00:03.491
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:03.491 --> 00:10.557
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:10.557 --> 00:13.124
- Ladies and gentlemen!
- 女士们，先生们！

00:13.124 --> 00:17.057
Behold my wondrous paintings!
看我奇妙的画作！

00:18.491 --> 00:22.757
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:22.757 --> 00:24.791
- Um, excuse me.
Can I have some ketchup?
- 嗯，对不起。
我可以喝点番茄酱吗？

00:24.791 --> 00:26.557
- Hey, look at my art,
you dummies!
- 嘿，看看我的艺术，
你们这些傻瓜！

00:26.557 --> 00:29.224
- Oh!
- 哦！

00:29.224 --> 00:32.224
- I don't know how you talked me
into this art show, SpongeBob,
- 我不知道你是怎么跟我说话的
进入这个艺术展，海绵宝宝，

00:32.224 --> 00:35.057
but I'm shutting this thing down
right now.
但我要关闭这个东西
现在。

00:35.057 --> 00:36.691
- Aw, you can't, Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，你不能，蟹老板。

00:36.691 --> 00:38.891
Wait until Squidward sells
some of his paintings.
等章鱼哥卖了
他的一些画作。

00:38.891 --> 00:40.891
- Buy some important paintings.
- 购买一些重要的画作。

00:40.891 --> 00:44.324
See me expose my exquisite
suffering.
看我暴露我的精致
痛苦。

00:44.324 --> 00:46.757
Hmm.
These fools don't even recognize
唔。
这些傻子根本不认识

00:46.757 --> 00:49.024
the masterworks
in front of their faces.
杰作
当着他们的面。

00:49.024 --> 00:53.091
I'll confront them
with the power of my art.
我会面对他们
用我的艺术的力量。

00:53.091 --> 00:55.557
- Ahh--
- Witness the beauty!
- 啊啊--
- 见证美丽！

00:55.557 --> 00:57.524
- Pah!
- 呸！

00:57.524 --> 00:58.691
- Come on, Larry,
- 来吧，拉里，

00:58.691 --> 00:59.824
get your salad on!
吃沙拉吧！

00:59.824 --> 01:02.791
- Come on, Larry,
get your art on!
- 来吧，拉里，
继续你的艺术吧！

01:02.791 --> 01:04.757
- Oohee!
My eyes!
- 哦嘿！
我的眼睛！

01:04.757 --> 01:07.057
[screaming]
[尖叫]

01:07.057 --> 01:09.024
The pain!
痛苦！

01:11.857 --> 01:13.524
- I want a Kwabby Meal!
- 我想要一顿卡瓦比餐！

01:13.524 --> 01:16.591
- How about some art
to go with that?
- 一些艺术怎么样
去那个？

01:16.591 --> 01:18.557
[horse neighs]
[马嘶声]

01:18.557 --> 01:20.557
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:20.557 --> 01:21.757
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:21.757 --> 01:24.991
Run, baby, run!
奔跑吧，宝贝，奔跑吧！

01:24.991 --> 01:28.024
- That's it! Squidward is
scaring me customers away.
- 就是这样！章鱼哥是
把我的顾客吓跑了。

01:28.024 --> 01:30.424
I'm shutting this art show down.
我要关闭这个艺术展。

01:30.424 --> 01:32.557
He's never gonna
sell his paintings.
他永远不会
卖他的画。

01:32.557 --> 01:34.891
- Sure, he will.
I just bought one.
- 当然，他会的。
我刚买了一个。

01:34.891 --> 01:36.791
- Ah! Holy shrimp.
- 啊！圣虾。

01:36.791 --> 01:38.857
Why would you do that
to yourself?
你为什么要这么做
对你自己？

01:38.857 --> 01:40.257
- What do you mean? I love it.
- 你是什么意思？我喜欢它。

01:40.257 --> 01:41.691
- Ah.
- 啊。

01:41.691 --> 01:44.391
- Mr. Krabs,
Squidward is our friend,
- 蟹老板先生，
章鱼哥是我们的朋友

01:44.391 --> 01:46.257
and his paintings are so cheap.
而且他的画很便宜。

01:46.257 --> 01:48.524
You should buy one
just to be nice.
你应该买一个
只是为了表现得好。

01:48.524 --> 01:50.157
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

01:50.157 --> 01:51.324
I'm good.
我很好。

01:51.324 --> 01:53.791
- Nice?
Nice?
- 好的？
好的？

01:53.791 --> 01:56.724
I don't waste my money on nice.
我不会把钱浪费在美好的事情上。

01:56.724 --> 01:59.791
- But think about how valuable
these paintings might become.
- 但想想有多么有价值
这些画可能会成为。

01:59.791 --> 02:01.557
- Valuable?
What do you mean?
- 有价值的？
你是什​​么意思？

02:01.557 --> 02:05.591
- When art gets older,
it usually gets more expensive.
- 当艺术变老时，
它通常会变得更贵。

02:05.591 --> 02:08.691
Squidward's paintings
might be worth millions someday.
章鱼哥的画作
有一天可能价值数百万美元。

02:08.691 --> 02:10.557
- Millions?
- 数百万？

02:10.557 --> 02:12.091
Out of me way!
别挡我的路！

02:12.091 --> 02:15.091
Here!
- Ow.
这里！
- 噢。

02:15.091 --> 02:15.891
- Gimme.
- 给我。

02:15.891 --> 02:17.524
This is mine now!
现在这是我的了！

02:17.524 --> 02:18.891
- Okay, Mr. Krabs!
- 好的，蟹老板！

02:18.891 --> 02:20.891
- [laughing]
Art, art, art, art, art, art.
- [笑]
艺术，艺术，艺术，艺术，艺术，艺术。

02:20.891 --> 02:23.257
Now all I need to do is sit back
现在我需要做的就是坐下来

02:23.257 --> 02:26.691
and watch me art
grow more valuable.
看我的艺术
变得更有价值。

02:26.691 --> 02:28.891
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

02:28.891 --> 02:32.157
- I am a very important
art appraiser,
- 我是一个非常重要的人
艺术鉴定师、

02:32.157 --> 02:34.557
and I say this so-called "art"
我说这就是所谓的“艺术”

02:34.557 --> 02:36.157
will never be worth a penny.
永远不会值一分钱。

02:36.157 --> 02:38.091
- Hey, Eugene H. Krabs
does not--
- 嘿，尤金·克拉布斯
不——

02:38.091 --> 02:40.924
[gags]
Lose money.
[笑点]
赔钱。

02:40.924 --> 02:42.957
There must be
something I can do
一定有
我能做的事

02:42.957 --> 02:45.491
to make this art
worth lots more cash.
来创作这门艺术
值更多现金。

02:45.491 --> 02:47.024
- Hmm...
- 唔...

02:47.024 --> 02:49.091
- I sold all my art?
- 我卖掉了所有的艺术品？

02:49.091 --> 02:53.191
This tiny handful of coins
has legitimized me!
这一小把硬币
使我合法化了！

02:54.491 --> 02:58.524
Who wants the autograph
of a real artiste?
谁想要签名
一个真正的艺术家？

02:58.524 --> 03:00.557
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

03:00.557 --> 03:03.457
- Ahh!
- 啊！

03:03.457 --> 03:04.757
- Well,
- 出色地，

03:04.757 --> 03:07.457
paintings can become
much more valuable
画可以变成
更有价值

03:07.457 --> 03:10.691
when the artist
is not longer with us.
当艺术家
不再和我们在一起了。

03:10.691 --> 03:13.391
You know, out of the picture.
你知道，在照片之外。

03:13.391 --> 03:14.791
[gags]
[笑点]

03:14.791 --> 03:17.724
- Out of the picture, eh?
- 不在画面中，是吗？

03:17.724 --> 03:20.091
I think I could arrange that.
我想我可以安排一下。

03:20.091 --> 03:22.857
- Artist walking--
check me out.
- 艺术家行走--
检查一下我。

03:22.857 --> 03:24.157
- Check this out.
- 看看这个。

03:24.157 --> 03:26.024
Got a delivery for you,
Mr. Squidward.
已经给你送来了，
章鱼哥先生。

03:26.024 --> 03:28.124
- What? You can't be serious.
- 什么？你不可能是认真的。

03:28.124 --> 03:31.124
An artist, such as myself,
should not be subject
一个艺术家，比如我自己，
不应成为主题

03:31.124 --> 03:33.357
to such menial tasks.
去完成这些琐碎的任务。

03:33.357 --> 03:36.124
Aw, don't be menial
to Squidward, Mr. Krabs.
哎哟，别卑鄙啊
致章鱼哥，蟹老板。

03:36.124 --> 03:37.357
I'll take the delivery.
我来取货。

03:37.357 --> 03:38.457
- No.
- 不。

03:38.457 --> 03:41.024
Mr. Squidward is
a real artist now,
章鱼哥先生是
现在是一个真正的艺术家，

03:41.024 --> 03:45.324
and real artists
can handle anything.
和真正的艺术家
可以处理任何事情。

03:45.324 --> 03:46.124
[wind whistling]
[风呼啸]

03:46.124 --> 03:48.857
- The Arctic is so cold.
- 北极太冷了。

03:48.857 --> 03:51.124
[shivering]
[发抖]

03:51.124 --> 03:52.724
Come on, Squidward,
来吧，章鱼哥，

03:52.724 --> 03:54.424
you're a strong artist.
你是一位实力雄厚的艺术家。

03:54.424 --> 03:56.524
You can do it!
你能做到！

03:56.524 --> 03:58.424
Nope.
没有。

03:58.424 --> 03:59.457
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:59.457 --> 04:00.857
[shivering]
[发抖]

04:00.857 --> 04:02.057
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

04:02.057 --> 04:03.357
- Oh, hey, Squidward!
- Ah!
- 哦，嘿，章鱼哥！
- 啊！

04:03.357 --> 04:05.091
SpongeBob,
what are you doing here?
海绵宝宝，
你在这里做什么？

04:05.091 --> 04:06.357
- Just getting some ice.
- 只是拿点冰块。

04:06.357 --> 04:07.857
Fresh!
新鲜的！

04:09.224 --> 04:11.357
[laughs]
Need some help?
[笑]
需要帮助吗？

04:11.357 --> 04:12.157
Oh!
哦！

04:12.157 --> 04:14.257
[humming cheerfully]
[欢快地哼唱]

04:16.691 --> 04:19.124
- Here's your food.
- 这是你的食物。

04:23.791 --> 04:27.557
- Hey, this is cold!
- 嘿，这很冷！

04:27.557 --> 04:28.957
Perfect!
完美的！

04:28.957 --> 04:33.191
[both laughing]
- Dah!
[两人都笑了]
- 啊！

04:33.191 --> 04:36.357
- Eh, we better get you home.
- 呃，我们最好送你回家。

04:36.357 --> 04:39.291
- Hello.
Is this the art appraiser?
- 你好。
这是艺术品鉴定师吗？

04:39.291 --> 04:40.591
Just wanted to let you know
只是想让你知道

04:40.591 --> 04:43.691
that me good, good friend
Squidward is now
我好，好朋友
章鱼哥现在是

04:43.691 --> 04:45.391
out of the pictu--
从图中——

04:45.391 --> 04:47.924
[stammering]
Wha-what the sea horse?
[结巴]
哇什么海马？

04:47.924 --> 04:49.957
Got another delivery for you,
Squidward.
又给你送了一份货
章鱼哥。

04:49.957 --> 04:51.991
And only Squidward!
而且只有章鱼哥！

04:51.991 --> 04:53.824
- Your eyes are so pretty.
- 你的眼睛真漂亮。

04:53.824 --> 04:56.357
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

04:58.757 --> 04:59.791
- Last...
[blows raspberry]
- 最后...
[吹覆盆子]

04:59.791 --> 05:00.824
Stop...
[blows raspberry]
停止...
[吹覆盆子]

05:00.824 --> 05:01.857
Rock...
[blows raspberry]
摇滚...
[吹覆盆子]

05:01.857 --> 05:05.791
Bottom.
[blows raspberry]
底部。
[吹覆盆子]

05:05.791 --> 05:07.957
- [moaning strangely]
- [奇怪地呻吟]

05:07.957 --> 05:12.057
- [moaning
and blowing raspberries]
- [呻吟
和吹覆盆子]

05:12.057 --> 05:14.557
- 237 Rock Bottom.
- 237 最低点。

05:14.557 --> 05:16.291
Oh, there it is!
哦，就在那里！

05:16.291 --> 05:17.957
Oh, remember, Squidward,
哦，记住，章鱼哥，

05:17.957 --> 05:20.991
real artists
embrace the unknown.
真正的艺术家
拥抱未知。

05:20.991 --> 05:23.457
Uh, is anyone here?
呃，有人在吗？

05:23.457 --> 05:25.324
[blows raspberry]
I've got a delivery
[吹覆盆子]
我有送货

05:25.324 --> 05:26.757
from the Krusty...
[blows raspberry]
来自库斯蒂...
[吹覆盆子]

05:26.757 --> 05:27.757
Krab.
蟹。

05:27.757 --> 05:29.024
[all blowing raspberries]
【都吹树莓】

05:29.024 --> 05:30.791
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

05:30.791 --> 05:31.957
- What are we screaming about?
- 我们在尖叫什么？

05:31.957 --> 05:33.457
- Monsters!
- 怪物！

05:33.457 --> 05:34.857
- They're not monsters,
Squidward,
- 他们不是怪物
章鱼哥，

05:34.857 --> 05:35.991
they're my friends.
他们是我的朋友。

05:35.991 --> 05:37.057
- What...
[blows raspberry]
- 什么...
[吹覆盆子]

05:37.057 --> 05:38.191
Up...
[blows raspberry]
上...
[吹覆盆子]

05:38.191 --> 05:40.091
SpongeBob?
[blows raspberry]
海绵宝宝？
[吹覆盆子]

05:40.091 --> 05:43.091
[all blowing raspberries
and cheering]
[都吹树莓
和欢呼]

05:43.091 --> 05:45.157
- Yes, I am sure
that Mr. Squidward
- 是的，我确定
那个章鱼哥先生

05:45.157 --> 05:46.557
is out of the picture for good.
永远不存在了。

05:46.557 --> 05:47.691
He will be missed.
人们会想念他的。

05:47.691 --> 05:49.491
So come on over
and tell old Krabs
所以过来吧
并告诉老蟹

05:49.491 --> 05:51.691
how much money
me paintings are worth.
多少钱
我的画是值得的。

05:51.691 --> 05:52.991
[laughs]
[笑]

05:52.991 --> 05:55.857
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:55.857 --> 05:57.757
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:57.757 --> 06:00.557
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

06:00.557 --> 06:01.691
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:01.691 --> 06:04.757
Squidward, delivery!
乌贼王，送货！

06:04.757 --> 06:06.724
- Ooh, this tickles.
[laughs]
- 哦，这很痒。
[笑]

06:06.724 --> 06:07.724
- [Mr. Krabs grunts]
- [先生。螃蟹咕哝]

06:07.724 --> 06:09.124
Follow me, Mr. Squidward.
跟我来，章鱼哥先生。

06:09.124 --> 06:11.724
I've got a special delivery
vehicle
我有一份特别的快递
车辆

06:11.724 --> 06:14.391
just for a great artist
like yourself.
只为一位伟大的艺术家
就像你自己一样。

06:14.391 --> 06:16.324
- Well, that's more like it.
- 嗯，这更像是这样。

06:16.324 --> 06:18.324
Finally some respect.
终于有点尊重了。

06:18.324 --> 06:19.924
- Into the rocket you go.
- 进入火箭。

06:19.924 --> 06:21.324
- Ah!
Ooh.
- 啊！
哦。

06:21.324 --> 06:23.024
Wait, why do I need a rocket?
等等，为什么我需要火箭？

06:23.024 --> 06:24.691
Where is this delivery to?
这次送货到哪里？

06:24.691 --> 06:25.891
- Mars.
- 火星。

06:25.891 --> 06:27.524
- Oh, Mars. Well--
- 哦，火星。出色地 -

06:27.524 --> 06:29.291
M-M-M-Mars?
火星？

06:29.291 --> 06:30.691
- Bye, Squidward.
- 再见，章鱼哥。

06:30.691 --> 06:33.691
- [Squidward screaming]
- [章鱼哥尖叫]

06:36.057 --> 06:37.824
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

06:37.824 --> 06:41.124
- Delivery from the Krusty Krab.
- 蟹堡王送货。

06:41.124 --> 06:44.257
- [speaking gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

06:47.091 --> 06:49.591
[all chomping]
[全部咀嚼]

06:49.591 --> 06:52.791
- Hmm.
All this red, so garish.
- 唔。
都是红色的，太艳丽了。

06:52.791 --> 06:55.824
Ah, this dump needs
a true artist's touch.
啊，这个转储需要
真正的艺术家风格。

06:55.824 --> 06:57.191
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

06:57.191 --> 06:59.024
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

06:59.024 --> 07:01.024
[munching sounds]
[咀嚼声]

07:01.024 --> 07:02.557
- So now that Squidward
definitely,
- 所以现在章鱼哥
绝对，

07:02.557 --> 07:05.124
100% is gone for good--
what a shame--
100%已经消失了——
真可惜——

07:05.124 --> 07:07.691
what do you think
of these here paintings?
你觉得怎么样
这里有这些画吗？

07:07.691 --> 07:09.224
- Well, of course,
they're awful,
- 嗯，当然，
他们太可怕了，

07:09.224 --> 07:11.924
but if the so-called "artist"
但如果所谓的“艺术家”

07:11.924 --> 07:13.591
is really out of the picture,
实在是出乎意料了，

07:13.591 --> 07:15.857
then perhaps
they're worth something.
那么也许
它们是有价值的。

07:15.857 --> 07:17.124
- Really?
- 真的吗？

07:17.124 --> 07:19.591
[sobbing]
It's so complicated.
[抽泣]
太复杂了。

07:19.591 --> 07:22.591
These are tears of joy, but
they're also tears of sadness
这是喜悦的泪水，但是
它们也是悲伤的泪水

07:22.591 --> 07:24.824
for my good friend Squidward,
为了我的好朋友章鱼哥，

07:24.824 --> 07:26.457
wherever he is.
无论他在哪里。

07:26.457 --> 07:28.757
- Oh, there he is, Mr. Krabs.
- [grunts]
- 哦，他在那儿，蟹老板。
- [咕哝]

07:28.757 --> 07:31.224
[ship whirring]
[船呼呼地响]

07:31.224 --> 07:35.057
- Stay here and keep an eye
on me investments.
- 留在这里并留意
对我的投资。

07:35.057 --> 07:37.857
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

07:37.857 --> 07:40.791
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

07:42.057 --> 07:44.457
Well, that was disgusting.
嗯，那太恶心了。

07:44.457 --> 07:47.857
So who wants to talk about
my use of color
那么谁想谈论
我对颜色的运用

07:47.857 --> 07:49.891
and brush stroke?
和笔触？

07:49.891 --> 07:51.491
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

07:51.491 --> 07:53.024
Hm!
嗯！

07:53.024 --> 07:55.324
- I have done everything I could
- 我已经做了我能做的一切

07:55.324 --> 07:57.524
to get you away from here
safely.
让你离开这里
安全。

07:57.524 --> 07:59.157
- Ah!
- Now you're messing
- 啊！
- 现在你搞砸了

07:59.157 --> 08:01.357
with me money!
用我的钱！

08:01.357 --> 08:02.191
- Dah!
- 啊！

08:02.191 --> 08:03.557
- Run, Squidward, run!
- 快跑，章鱼哥，快跑！

08:03.557 --> 08:04.491
- Hey!
- 嘿！

08:04.491 --> 08:06.857
How about a little support here?
在这里提供一点支持怎么样？

08:06.857 --> 08:08.524
- Run, Mr. Krabs, run!
- 快跑，蟹老板，快跑！

08:08.524 --> 08:09.924
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:09.924 --> 08:12.557
- [quietly] But a little slower
than Squidward!
- [小声]但是慢一点
比章鱼哥！

08:14.591 --> 08:17.191
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

08:17.191 --> 08:20.657
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

08:20.657 --> 08:22.624
- [muffled shouting]
- It's your best friend,
- [低声喊叫]
- 这是你最好的朋友

08:22.624 --> 08:23.624
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

08:23.624 --> 08:24.924
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:24.924 --> 08:26.757
- Oh, get off of me!
- 哦，从我身上下来！

08:26.757 --> 08:28.424
- I'll never get off of you,
Squidward.
-我永远不会离开你
章鱼哥。

08:28.424 --> 08:29.924
Not until you're safe.
直到你安全为止。

08:29.924 --> 08:31.424
- I'll never be safe!
- 我永远不会安全！

08:31.424 --> 08:33.024
Not until my paintings are gone.
直到我的画消失了。

08:33.024 --> 08:34.391
- No, Squidward!
- 不，章鱼哥！

08:34.391 --> 08:36.624
You can't deprive the world
of your paintings!
你无法剥夺世界
你的画作！

08:36.624 --> 08:39.824
- True, but it's better than
depriving the world of me.
- 确实如此，但比
剥夺了我的世界。

08:39.824 --> 08:40.957
Hmm?
唔？

08:40.957 --> 08:42.591
- [growls]
- Ah!
- [咆哮]
- 啊！

08:42.591 --> 08:44.724
- [laughing]
- [笑]

08:44.724 --> 08:46.924
- Come on, Squidward,
destroy those paintings
- 来吧，章鱼哥，
毁掉那些画

08:46.924 --> 08:48.924
before Mr. Krabs gets back.
在蟹老板回来之前。

08:48.924 --> 08:50.957
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:50.957 --> 08:53.324
I--I can't do it!
我——我做不到！

08:53.324 --> 08:55.891
They're just too magnificent!
他们简直太伟大了！

08:55.891 --> 08:57.757
- Hey, hey, hey!
- 嘿，嘿，嘿！

08:57.757 --> 08:59.857
Get away from me paintings!
离我远点画画！

08:59.857 --> 09:03.224
- Oh, I'm sorry, paintings,
but it's you or me!
- 哦，对不起，绘画，
但这是你还是我！

09:03.224 --> 09:06.091
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:06.091 --> 09:08.091
- Yes. Yes!
- 是的。是的！

09:08.091 --> 09:10.824
Now this is true art!
这才是真正的艺术！

09:10.824 --> 09:11.757
- Wha--really?
- 啥——真的吗？

09:11.757 --> 09:14.991
- So visceral, so dangerous.
- 如此本能，如此危险。

09:14.991 --> 09:16.324
- Yes!
- 是的！

09:16.324 --> 09:18.324
Feel my art!
感受我的艺术！

09:18.324 --> 09:20.291
[laughing]
[笑]

09:20.291 --> 09:23.757
- Leave me paintings alone,
you monster!
- 别管我的画，
你这个怪物！

09:23.757 --> 09:25.124
- No!
- 不！

09:25.124 --> 09:27.457
That was the most exhilarating
performance art
那是最激动人心的
行为艺术

09:27.457 --> 09:29.524
I have ever seen!
我见过！

09:29.524 --> 09:30.424
- Really?
- 真的吗？

09:30.424 --> 09:33.357
So it must be worth millions!
那么它的价值一定是几百万！

09:33.357 --> 09:35.224
Hey, out of me way!
嘿，别挡我的路！

09:35.224 --> 09:38.357
[both laughing maniacally]
[两人都疯狂大笑]

09:42.357 --> 09:45.124
- [laughing]
- [笑]

09:45.124 --> 09:46.757
- [laughing]
Mr. Krabs, uh, Squidward,
- [笑]
螃蟹先生，呃，章鱼哥，

09:46.757 --> 09:48.391
I don't think
you should be doing that.
我不认为
你应该这样做。

09:48.391 --> 09:51.557
- Oh, don't be so provincial,
SpongeBob.
-哦，别那么狭隘，
海绵宝宝。

09:51.557 --> 09:54.691
- Yeah, stop trying
to censor our money!
- 是的，别再尝试了
审查我们的钱！

09:54.691 --> 09:56.057
I mean, our art!
我的意思是，我们的艺术！

09:56.057 --> 09:59.024
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:59.024 --> 10:02.157
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

10:03.124 --> 10:04.424
There!
那里！

10:09.691 --> 10:10.991
- Bravo!
- 太棒了！

10:10.991 --> 10:13.691
Bravo! Bravo!
太棒了！太棒了！

10:13.691 --> 10:16.824
[both grunting and yelling]
[咕哝和大喊]

10:18.891 --> 10:21.591
- Ooh, boy, hee-hee!
- 哦，孩子，嘿嘿！

10:21.591 --> 10:23.357
So, heh,
所以，呵呵，

10:23.357 --> 10:25.224
how much you gonna give me
for all this?
你要给我多少钱
为了这一切？

10:25.224 --> 10:27.057
[chuckles]
- Nothing!
[笑声]
- 没什么！

10:27.057 --> 10:29.591
Performance art is about
the moment.
行为艺术是关于
那一刻。

10:29.591 --> 10:31.357
You cannot put a price on it.
你无法为其定价。

10:31.357 --> 10:33.857
- What?
Wait. Come back here,
- 什么？
等待。回到这里，

10:33.857 --> 10:36.691
you double-crossing--
你这双重交叉——

10:36.691 --> 10:39.791
- Doh! Mr. Krabs!
Squidward!
- 噢！蟹老板！
章鱼哥！

10:39.791 --> 10:40.791
[strains]
[菌株]

10:40.791 --> 10:43.957
- A-ha!
- 啊哈！

10:43.957 --> 10:47.957
And that is how I acquired
this masterpiece.
这就是我如何获得
这部杰作。

10:47.957 --> 10:49.724
- Ooh.
- Ahh.
- 哦。
- 啊。

10:49.724 --> 10:51.024
- Bravo.
- 太棒了。

10:51.024 --> 10:53.057
- I'm an artist.
- 我是一名艺术家。

10:53.057 --> 10:55.257
- I'm rich.
- 我很有钱。

10:55.257 --> 10:58.457
- And I helped.
[laughs]
- 我也帮忙了。
[笑]

11:00.691 --> 11:03.891
[light string music]
[轻弦乐]

11:03.891 --> 11:10.891
*
*
*
*

*